config MI_WIFI_GPIO
	tristate "Xiaomi Wi-Fi SAR GPIO"
	depends on OF && GPIOLIB && NET && MI_HARDWARE_ID
	help
	  Report the board SAR GPIO through the Xiaomi wifi_sar netlink family.
	  Only boards identified as Chinese by supplied HWID parameters bind.
	  This is the SAR notification interface, not the WLAN radio driver.
	  To build a module, choose M; it is called xiaomi_wifi_gpio.
